Here-:

<!DOCTYPE html> defines the version of html used. (HTML5)

<html lang="en"> root element of the document. Lang attribute defines the Language of the document. here, it is English.

<head> contains information about the document.

<meta charset="UTF-8"> specifies the character encoding.

<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"> helps the page adapt to mobile screens.

<title> gives title of the document. (browser tab title)

<body> contains the main content of the web page.

<h1>,<h2>, <h3>..., <h6> heading tag of different sizes, used to define the importance of the text in the web page.
<p> is use for paragraphs 
